I got one response and it fixed the problem - thanks to Jason Orendorf of
HP:

You might try deleting the device completely and rescanning:

# hwmgr -delete comp -id 179
# hwmgr show scsi
(make sure it's gone)
# hwmgr -scan scsi
(make sure it's back)
# dsfmgr -m tape? tape0    (if needed)
# drdmgr tape0
(see what's reported)

Hope this helps.

  Jason Orendorf - HP Tru64 Unix Enterprise Team
  HP Services

